//窺っておることは疑いもなき事」
"I'm afraid that in this, Shishiku is correct. We face peril. Our foundation has cracked, and our enemies are poised to leap. Foremost among them is GHQ, but let us not forget the many rebels still lurking in the shadows."

pt:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0050630a09'>
