<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/mb01/0050780a07'>
//「残念だったな秀吉くん。
//　まっ、大徳寺はまたにしとけよ。信長公も
//秀勝も逃げやしねーからさ」
"Too bad, eh, Hideyoshi? I know you're in a rush to bury Nobunaga, but Daitokuji's gonna have to wait. Don't worry. Little Hidekatsu ain't going anywhere."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/mb01/0050780a07'>
