//公方が足並みを揃えて国難にあたる為にも、」
"While I do not object to your assuming the role, I'm afraid our colleagues here feel that you are not yet ready. And in this, perhaps they have a point. And these are trying times."

//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051590a09'>
//「如何でござるかなァ。
//　今回はひとまず、見送っては……」
"For the sake of consensus, and the good of Rokuhara, will you not set your claim aside?"

pt:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051570a09'>
//「いや、冗談でござるよ。雷蝶殿。
//　まぁそう、お焦り召されるな」
"É uma brincadeira, Raicho. Não nos deixemos levar pela pressa."

//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051580a09'>
//「それがしに異論はござらぬが……どうやら
//お二方は時期尚早と考えておられる様子。
