"Sim?"

en:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051690a09'>
//「雷蝶殿が城に残られるのも反対でござるか。
//　しからば邦氏公を守るお役目、<RUBY text='どなた'>何方</RUBY>が務め
//ればよろしかろう？」
"You object to Raicho remaining behind in any capacity, correct? Who would you have act as Lord Kuniuji's guardian?"

pt:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051690a09'>
//「雷蝶殿が城に残られるのも反対でござるか。
//　しからば邦氏公を守るお役目、<RUBY text='どなた'>何方</RUBY>が務め
//ればよろしかろう？」
"Tu te opões a que Raicho fique para trás em qualquer função, certo? Quem gostarias que servisse como guardião do Lorde Kuniuji?"

en:
