"Falou tudo, cara. Aquela garota é encrenca."

en:
//【獅子吼】
<voice name='獅子吼' class='獅子吼' src='voice/mb01/0051720a06'>
//「消去法で、童心殿しかおらん」
"That makes you the only logical choice."

pt:
