//お守り致そう」
"Then though this be an honor far above my station, I have no choice but to accept. On pain of death, this humble monk shall protect our lord in your absence."

//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb01/0051840a09'>
//「方々は管区に戻られ、諸事を片付けられた
//のち、再びご登城下されい」
"Please see to your districts, generals, and return to Fudaraku once affairs are settled."

